WEBVTT

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:09.426
NETFLIX ORIGINAL ANIME SERIES

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:15.807
ORIGINAL WORK BY KOUSUKE OONO

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.811
PRODUCED BY NETFLIX

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:43.561
Promotions? Check.

00:01:44.145 --> 00:01:45.021
Price? Check.

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:46.064
Freshness? Check.

00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:48.566
Next shop, locked on target!

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:49.484
SMACK

00:01:51.903 --> 00:01:53.196
Immortal Tatsu.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:55.073
<i>This guy is…</i>

00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:57.408
Hey, remember me?

00:01:58.201 --> 00:02:00.870
I'm from the Hirako Group,
the one you took out!

00:02:03.373 --> 00:02:05.375
Mic check. One, two.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:09.754
<i>Here I am, the top ranker
A former yakuza, a dope rapper</i>

00:02:09.838 --> 00:02:12.298
<i>I never forgot that honor we had</i>

00:02:12.382 --> 00:02:14.717
<i>Riskin' our lives 'coz we were so bad</i>

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.845
<i>The day I'm gonna take your heart
Isn't far</i>

00:02:16.928 --> 00:02:19.472
<i>That's right, my name is G-GODA!</i>

00:02:20.557 --> 00:02:21.432
SCREECH

00:02:22.058 --> 00:02:22.976
Goda.

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:26.896
<i>I'm a househusband, yo
My apron is my battle gear</i>

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:31.109
<i>Housework, cooking, and cleaning
Water-wash, machine wash, scrub wash</i>

00:02:31.192 --> 00:02:34.195
<i>Humidifier, dehumidifier, purifier</i>

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.491
Audience! Make some noise!

00:02:39.075 --> 00:02:39.951
<i>What?</i>

00:02:40.034 --> 00:02:42.662
<i>We haven't forgotten how you busted us out</i>

00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:45.081
<i>But now, it's my turn
For the victory shout</i>

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:48.751
<i>Teriyaki, sukiyaki,</i> tamagoyaki
<i>I love 'em all!</i>

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:51.296
This is a freestyle rap battle.

00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:53.172
Their beliefs or the other's weaknesses

00:02:53.256 --> 00:02:55.216
are exchanged in improvised rhymes.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.928
Fun fact, a famous rapper was recently
caught using a voice actor in a track--

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:01.014
<i>Immortal Tatsu, you've gone soft</i>

00:03:01.097 --> 00:03:03.474
<i>You have to diss me, yo
That's the point of freestyle</i>

00:03:03.558 --> 00:03:04.851
<i>Your clothes are weird!</i>

00:03:06.436 --> 00:03:07.270
COLLAPSE

00:03:08.396 --> 00:03:10.273
That's not even true.

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:12.483
Well, I was only…

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:13.860
Sorry.

00:03:13.943 --> 00:03:15.612
<i>-He apologized!
-He apologized!</i>

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:16.905
Let's try that again.

00:03:16.988 --> 00:03:18.323
Okay? Come on.

00:03:18.406 --> 00:03:20.450
Look, how about that?

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:21.534
The theme is "meat."

00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:22.619
BAM

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:24.621
I don't do themes, yo.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.333
What's up with all the noise?

00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:30.335
<i>The pork's price makes you smile</i>

00:03:30.418 --> 00:03:31.336
Wha…

00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:33.296
<i>Today's winner for dinner is ox tongue</i>

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:37.759
<i>That price of chicken is a sin
He's obviously up to somethin'</i>

00:03:37.842 --> 00:03:40.511
<i>The meat is juicy
But the owner looks like Kewpie!</i>

00:03:40.595 --> 00:03:41.512
SMACK

00:03:42.096 --> 00:03:44.015
Ah, "cutie" is a better fit…

00:03:44.098 --> 00:03:48.645
<i>Yo, it's my turn next
I'll blow you away with no-gimmick lyrics</i>

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:52.106
<i>The fat runs through the meat
The sense runs through me</i>

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.524
<i>Yeah, the meat…</i>

00:03:53.608 --> 00:03:56.694
<i>Um, you cut the meat
And get the bones… No…</i>

00:03:56.778 --> 00:03:59.447
<i>Try and cut that meat, the bones…</i>

00:04:03.826 --> 00:04:07.455
That's it… I'm done!

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:14.128
<i>Fried chicken, pork cutlet
Grilled meat for all</i>

00:04:14.212 --> 00:04:18.591
<i>If you want meat</i>

00:04:18.675 --> 00:04:21.678
<i>Come to The Ultimate Meat</i>

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:23.596
Well, um…

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.056
You're not supposed to sing…

00:04:26.557 --> 00:04:28.059
<i>The Way of the Househusband.</i>

00:04:30.645 --> 00:04:32.438
Okay, I'm off to my business trip.

00:04:32.522 --> 00:04:34.524
I'll probably be back tomorrow night.

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:37.068
Do you have your purse and cell phone?

00:04:37.151 --> 00:04:38.486
And your portable umbrella?

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.198
It's just you here,
so why not take it easy for once?

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.367
Have a good trip…

00:04:46.202 --> 00:04:47.370
Take it easy…

00:04:49.205 --> 00:04:50.581
Right.

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:54.043
Take it easy.

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:56.713
The weather's looking good.

00:04:58.089 --> 00:05:01.467
Normally, I would wash the sheets
and hang up the futon.

00:05:02.051 --> 00:05:04.929
But today, I'm gonna take it easy.

00:05:05.013 --> 00:05:05.930
SPRAY

00:05:06.014 --> 00:05:08.599
This fabric refresher will do the job!

00:05:12.603 --> 00:05:14.397
Citrus fragrance!

00:05:14.897 --> 00:05:19.277
Usually, I bring in the washing
and fold each item one at a time,

00:05:19.861 --> 00:05:23.740
but there's this one sick hack I got
off the internet, strictly non-legit.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:27.076
Put the clothes away
while they're still on the hanger!

00:05:28.202 --> 00:05:30.663
I was gonna simmer
some veggies in stock for dinner,

00:05:31.789 --> 00:05:34.125
but why wait for
the water to boil up first?

00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:36.961
Just keep the lid on.

00:05:37.045 --> 00:05:40.048
Now for some of that stuff
no one goes near.

00:05:42.341 --> 00:05:44.469
BLOW

00:05:44.552 --> 00:05:45.386
NESSIN FOODS

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.346
Cup noodles for lunch.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.931
I'm such a junkie.

00:05:49.015 --> 00:05:50.433
DING DONG

00:05:51.017 --> 00:05:52.935
I got fired from my part-time job,
so I came by.

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:53.978
You…

00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:57.482
Huh? You're by yourself today?

00:05:57.565 --> 00:06:00.151
Yeah, I was planning on taking it easy.

00:06:00.735 --> 00:06:03.654
Let's do it
good and proper then, shall we?

00:06:06.199 --> 00:06:09.535
<i>Two adults playing video games
in the middle of a weekday…</i>

00:06:10.119 --> 00:06:11.537
<i>This guy</i>

00:06:12.121 --> 00:06:13.873
<i>is no amateur!</i>

00:06:19.378 --> 00:06:20.213
CLATTER

00:06:20.922 --> 00:06:22.465
Huh? Boss?

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:26.552
I need to do some washing,
grocery shopping, and bath cleaning too.

00:06:27.261 --> 00:06:28.471
I'm stepping down.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:30.431
What?

00:06:31.474 --> 00:06:32.892
Are you bailing out already?

00:06:33.643 --> 00:06:35.853
I thought you said you would take it easy!

00:06:35.937 --> 00:06:39.690
Okay, then. We can do one last thing.

00:06:41.192 --> 00:06:42.777
Kick back and eat some snacks,

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.570
look at your phone,

00:06:44.654 --> 00:06:46.030
and before you know it…

00:06:46.114 --> 00:06:47.031
SNORE

00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:49.534
<i>Wow, his laziness is on another level.</i>

00:06:49.617 --> 00:06:50.993
<i>This guy's a true master!</i>

00:06:51.994 --> 00:06:54.205
Shit, not good.

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:56.374
I can't take it anymore.

00:06:56.457 --> 00:06:57.750
The washing needs doing…

00:06:57.834 --> 00:06:58.918
And the bath…

00:06:59.001 --> 00:06:59.877
GRAB

00:07:00.837 --> 00:07:02.588
Masa? Let go!

00:07:03.172 --> 00:07:06.050
You promised you would take it easy!

00:07:06.926 --> 00:07:09.762
Come on, more…

00:07:16.018 --> 00:07:20.940
SMACK

00:07:21.524 --> 00:07:22.942
Let's enter this together.

00:07:23.526 --> 00:07:25.778
The Shopping District
Halloween Costume Contest.

00:07:27.029 --> 00:07:29.282
Halloween? Really?

00:07:29.365 --> 00:07:31.409
First place is a hot springs trip.

00:07:31.492 --> 00:07:33.202
Second place is…

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:34.412
a year's supply of rice.

00:07:35.204 --> 00:07:36.789
A whole year…

00:07:37.748 --> 00:07:39.584
HALLOWEEN COSTUME CONTEST

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:41.043
CONTESTANT WAITING ROOM

00:07:43.337 --> 00:07:46.591
What the heck are you doing here, huh?

00:07:46.674 --> 00:07:48.968
Well, you're lively.

00:07:49.051 --> 00:07:51.554
What about you?
Sure you got the right place?

00:07:51.637 --> 00:07:52.972
Stop it.

00:07:53.055 --> 00:07:55.016
I won't have your back
if you make trouble.

00:07:55.892 --> 00:07:58.895
I've got my eyes on
that premium Niigata rice.

00:07:58.978 --> 00:08:02.398
Hmph, you two don't have what it takes.

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:03.983
Stop with the games.

00:08:04.942 --> 00:08:07.278
There's no way
you'll be able to get that rice.

00:08:07.361 --> 00:08:09.197
<i>I'd prefer the hot springs trip.</i>

00:08:10.406 --> 00:08:12.492
Okay, everyone. Thanks for waiting.

00:08:12.575 --> 00:08:14.952
It's the Shopping District
Halloween Costume Contest.

00:08:15.536 --> 00:08:17.538
You can enter alone or as a group!

00:08:17.622 --> 00:08:20.625
We're looking for
that special Halloween look!

00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:22.001
So let's begin!

00:08:22.835 --> 00:08:25.588
Entry number 1 is the Torii Family.

00:08:26.172 --> 00:08:27.924
-Stop your prying eyes!
-What?

00:08:28.508 --> 00:08:30.676
So Torii Family,
what would you like to show us?

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:33.179
I'll let you in on my special skill.

00:08:33.262 --> 00:08:39.894
To start, we have 845 yen,
plus 493 yen, plus 884 yen.

00:08:39.977 --> 00:08:41.020
Wait, you're too quick!

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.064
<i>-An abacus?
-An abacus?</i>

00:08:43.731 --> 00:08:47.318
Entry number 2 is crepe maker Mr. Tora…

00:08:49.278 --> 00:08:50.279
Are you okay?

00:08:50.863 --> 00:08:52.031
A heavily injured Yaku--

00:08:52.114 --> 00:08:52.990
WHISTLE

00:08:53.574 --> 00:08:55.076
What is this? Let go of me!

00:08:55.159 --> 00:08:57.411
Let's… forget we saw that and move on.

00:08:57.495 --> 00:08:59.247
Next is entry number 3.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.957
Yes, over here.

00:09:03.626 --> 00:09:05.211
I overslept.

00:09:06.671 --> 00:09:07.922
-We'll skip that one.
-Huh?

00:09:08.005 --> 00:09:10.049
What a poor show.

00:09:10.633 --> 00:09:11.467
FLASH

00:09:11.551 --> 00:09:12.760
Entry number 4.

00:09:13.594 --> 00:09:15.972
Husband and wife Tatsu and Miku!

00:09:16.055 --> 00:09:16.973
SWISH

00:09:22.812 --> 00:09:24.480
CLANG, BANG

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:25.690
CLICK

00:09:25.773 --> 00:09:27.692
BUZZ

00:09:27.775 --> 00:09:29.026
BUZZ

00:09:29.944 --> 00:09:32.113
Decorated pumpkin cookies.

00:09:32.738 --> 00:09:34.740
Just a little something for you.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.286
Wow, a good bit of bribery!

00:09:39.412 --> 00:09:41.163
Now's the time for the results!

00:09:41.247 --> 00:09:43.416
The winner is entry number 9.

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:45.042
Yuko!

00:09:45.668 --> 00:09:47.545
Congratulations!

00:09:48.129 --> 00:09:49.255
Can't argue with that.

00:09:49.338 --> 00:09:54.260
KATAGI SHOPPING DISTRICT
HALLOWEEN COSTUME CONTEST

00:09:54.343 --> 00:09:55.344
FUWAFUWA KITCHEN

00:09:55.428 --> 00:09:56.262
EPISODE 46

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.724
-Two, please.
-Right this way.

00:10:00.308 --> 00:10:01.475
<i>This place</i>

00:10:01.559 --> 00:10:02.893
<i>is a battlefield.</i>

00:10:02.977 --> 00:10:04.729
I haven't been to a buffet in forever.

00:10:04.812 --> 00:10:07.523
You have 90 minutes to enjoy the buffet.

00:10:07.607 --> 00:10:08.441
Okay.

00:10:09.066 --> 00:10:10.401
Come on, let's go.

00:10:11.485 --> 00:10:13.362
<i>I gotta get my money's worth.</i>

00:10:14.238 --> 00:10:15.823
<i>That's a wide range of dishes.</i>

00:10:16.741 --> 00:10:18.784
<i>How should I plan my attack?</i>

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:20.995
Wow, this looks really good!

00:10:21.912 --> 00:10:25.082
<i>I could try a bit of each,
but there are a lot of dishes.</i>

00:10:25.708 --> 00:10:28.544
<i>If I go straight for the carbs,
that will fill me up too soon.</i>

00:10:28.628 --> 00:10:29.754
<i>First…</i>

00:10:30.338 --> 00:10:32.465
<i>I'll be sensible and attack the salad!</i>

00:10:32.548 --> 00:10:34.925
What? Starting with curry?

00:10:35.509 --> 00:10:37.136
<i>Is she actually serious?</i>

00:10:38.387 --> 00:10:42.308
<i>Gotta say though,
this main course lineup is top quality!</i>

00:10:43.434 --> 00:10:44.352
GULP

00:10:45.478 --> 00:10:49.857
<i>This is some risky business,
but I can't stop myself!</i>

00:10:50.441 --> 00:10:52.234
Seafood <i>doria</i>, fresh out of the oven!

00:10:52.902 --> 00:10:54.570
<i>Oh, god, look at that!</i>

00:10:57.239 --> 00:10:59.408
<i>There's no more space on my plate!</i>

00:11:00.326 --> 00:11:02.745
<i>I've been had.</i>

00:11:05.581 --> 00:11:07.416
I thought you couldn't decide,

00:11:08.167 --> 00:11:09.877
but you sure took a lot.

00:11:15.883 --> 00:11:17.301
Yeah, too much.

00:11:19.512 --> 00:11:20.471
Are you all right?

00:11:21.055 --> 00:11:24.683
It ain't over yet.
The highlight has yet to come.

00:11:26.268 --> 00:11:27.561
SWISH

00:11:28.145 --> 00:11:29.021
BAM

00:11:29.814 --> 00:11:30.981
Move it.

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.859
Don't say you want it too?

00:11:34.443 --> 00:11:37.405
The variety of
carefully cultivated fresh fruits.

00:11:37.488 --> 00:11:39.281
Fuwafuwa Kitchen's special creation.

00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:42.993
The fruit tart,
amply filled with cream cheese.

00:11:45.037 --> 00:11:47.415
-Do you even understand what this is?
-What?

00:11:47.998 --> 00:11:52.253
The farmers brought up these fruits
like their own little babies!

00:11:52.336 --> 00:11:54.255
The soft, velvety cream

00:11:54.338 --> 00:11:56.590
in harmony with the sweet and sour fruits!

00:11:57.174 --> 00:11:59.844
-That crisp pastry crust!
-The contrast in those flavors!

00:11:59.927 --> 00:12:00.803
<i>They're too close.</i>

00:12:01.971 --> 00:12:02.847
MARCH

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:03.806
CRASH

00:12:05.224 --> 00:12:06.642
Such power!

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:10.396
EMPTY

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:12.356
This is a battlefield.

00:12:13.023 --> 00:12:14.066
<i>-So strong!
-So strong!</i>

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.109
RETREAT

00:12:16.235 --> 00:12:17.987
Huh? What about dessert?

00:12:18.571 --> 00:12:19.488
Was it gone?

00:12:21.407 --> 00:12:23.784
I got some earlier. Wanna share?

00:12:23.868 --> 00:12:24.785
COVER

00:12:24.869 --> 00:12:25.744
Miku…

00:12:30.833 --> 00:12:31.667
EPISODE 47

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:33.961
That's a lot of food you've bought.
What's it for?

00:12:34.044 --> 00:12:37.673
What comes to mind
when you think of family get-togethers?

00:12:38.257 --> 00:12:39.133
What?

00:12:39.216 --> 00:12:41.051
Hot pot, of course!

00:12:42.678 --> 00:12:43.846
Mother, Father.

00:12:44.346 --> 00:12:45.764
Hi, Tatsu.

00:12:47.099 --> 00:12:48.225
Go on, dear.

00:12:50.269 --> 00:12:52.146
Well, um…

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:53.898
Let's have some hot pot.

00:12:53.981 --> 00:12:55.232
What? Uh…

00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:56.192
Sure.

00:12:56.984 --> 00:12:58.569
Okay, I'll start prepping.

00:12:58.652 --> 00:12:59.528
PAT

00:12:59.612 --> 00:13:01.238
You stay here.

00:13:01.322 --> 00:13:02.281
Huh?

00:13:02.364 --> 00:13:03.199
You're going to…

00:13:03.282 --> 00:13:04.116
PLONK

00:13:05.493 --> 00:13:06.368
ROLL

00:13:07.953 --> 00:13:09.038
Father!

00:13:09.622 --> 00:13:12.041
<i>He moves just like Miku!</i>

00:13:13.334 --> 00:13:14.251
Father!

00:13:15.127 --> 00:13:15.961
SPLASH, SPRAY

00:13:16.045 --> 00:13:17.004
Father!

00:13:17.922 --> 00:13:19.715
Father!

00:13:20.883 --> 00:13:21.717
<i>Tatsu.</i>

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:24.470
<i>That man cooks like a runaway train.</i>

00:13:24.553 --> 00:13:25.930
<i>Can he be stopped?</i>

00:13:26.764 --> 00:13:27.598
Tacchan.

00:13:28.098 --> 00:13:29.808
I'll help as well.

00:13:29.892 --> 00:13:31.477
Miku? No…

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.395
Dad, how can I help?

00:13:34.522 --> 00:13:35.397
<i>This is not good!</i>

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.943
<i>Both hooligans have joined forces!</i>

00:13:39.527 --> 00:13:41.278
Okay, you can make the stock.

00:13:41.362 --> 00:13:42.196
Okay.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.198
<i>The stock is the hot pot's lifeblood…</i>

00:13:45.157 --> 00:13:47.993
<i>That's the one thing I won't let you harm!</i>

00:13:50.246 --> 00:13:52.122
-Takes you back, doesn't it, Miku?
-Huh?

00:13:52.206 --> 00:13:53.040
SLASH

00:13:53.123 --> 00:13:55.501
We used to cook like this together.

00:13:56.293 --> 00:13:58.295
<i>You'd come up and offer to help.</i>

00:13:58.921 --> 00:13:59.922
SLASH

00:14:00.005 --> 00:14:00.839
Did I?

00:14:00.923 --> 00:14:01.757
SPLODGE

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.468
You were always a reckless kid.

00:14:04.552 --> 00:14:06.303
I wasn't that bad!

00:14:06.387 --> 00:14:09.598
You'd fall while running,
throw things, clothesline people…

00:14:09.682 --> 00:14:10.516
STICKY

00:14:10.599 --> 00:14:12.184
My blood froze just watching.

00:14:13.185 --> 00:14:14.270
But now…

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:19.858
It seems I don't have to worry about
protecting you anymore.

00:14:27.533 --> 00:14:29.243
I'm here for her. Don't you worry.

00:14:30.244 --> 00:14:31.453
Tatsu.

00:14:32.079 --> 00:14:34.164
Okay, we'll end it
with curry powder and ponzu.

00:14:35.291 --> 00:14:37.751
Rice, udon, and mochi.
Let's put it all in.

00:14:37.835 --> 00:14:38.961
<i>Oh, no.</i>

00:14:44.717 --> 00:14:45.759
Ready!

00:14:46.594 --> 00:14:51.682
<i>The power of a housewife…
Even hooligans will step in line!</i>

00:14:52.266 --> 00:14:53.893
Mother, I have nothing but respect.

00:14:53.976 --> 00:14:55.144
-Sorry?
-What?

00:14:55.227 --> 00:15:00.149
CHICKEN MEAT BALL

00:15:00.232 --> 00:15:02.109
EPISODE 48

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.823
<i>The way of a yakuza</i>

00:15:08.782 --> 00:15:10.659
<i>is the way of the househusband.</i>

00:15:11.243 --> 00:15:14.997
My daily hustle starts
with a packed lunch.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:17.958
<i>Boss…</i>

00:15:18.042 --> 00:15:19.543
<i>Have faith in me!</i>

00:15:19.627 --> 00:15:20.544
SMACK

00:15:20.628 --> 00:15:21.503
SWISH

00:15:23.547 --> 00:15:24.381
OPEN

00:15:25.049 --> 00:15:25.883
CLOSE

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:28.844
SHUT

00:15:30.137 --> 00:15:31.597
<i>There's nothing to eat.</i>

00:15:32.431 --> 00:15:34.558
<i>I really don't want to go shopping.</i>

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.818
What am I doing?
I'll pop out and get some stuff…

00:15:44.902 --> 00:15:46.779
SLIDE TO UNLOCK

00:15:47.446 --> 00:15:48.864
<i>Four o'clock.</i>

00:15:49.615 --> 00:15:50.616
<i>Oh, four.</i>

00:15:51.533 --> 00:15:52.785
<i>What? Four?</i>

00:15:52.868 --> 00:15:53.869
<i>Four…</i>

00:15:53.953 --> 00:15:55.287
<i>Wait, really?</i>

00:15:56.622 --> 00:15:58.290
<i>Well, I did get up in the afternoon.</i>

00:15:59.833 --> 00:16:00.918
<i>Boss…</i>

00:16:01.627 --> 00:16:02.711
<i>Today…</i>

00:16:03.545 --> 00:16:05.464
<i>You understand, right?</i>
